### Scoreboard API Test Endpoints

### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Registrar nuevo usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser1",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser1",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Get Profile (requires token from login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE


### Get Scoreboard (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard

###

### Get Scoreboard with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard?limit=5&page=1

###

### Get My Stats (requires token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard/my-stats
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Update Score (requires token)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard/update-score
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 100
}

###

### Update Daily Streak (requires token)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard/update-streak
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dailyStreak": 3
}

###

### Update Both Score and Streak (requires token)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard/update-stats
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 250,
  "dailyStreak": 5
}

###

### Get User by Username (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard/user/testuser1

###

### Change Password (requires token)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "password123",
  "newPassword": "newpassword456"
}

###

### Verify Token (requires token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Refresh Token (requires token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
